  "gameDifficulty": "Difficulty",
  "gameTicTacToeHow": "Line up three symbols in a row, column or diagonal before the phone does. You play X and go first.",
  "gameBattleshipHow": "Place your fleet (one carrier, two destroyers, two patrol boats) and sink the enemy's before the phone sinks yours. Difficulty changes how clever the phone is.",
  "gameSudokuHow": "Fill the grid with numbers 1 to 9 without repeating them in rows, columns and 3×3 boxes. The harder it is, the fewer numbers are given.",
  "gameMazeHow": "Drive the bus from the start to the flag. The maze is different every time, and the harder it is, the bigger it gets.",
  "gameBusJamHow": "Slide buses and minibuses to clear the road and get the red bus out of the car park. Each difficulty has 10 levels to unlock one by one: the fewer moves, the better.",
  "gameBlocks": "Block Puzzle 1010",
  "game2048": "2048",
  "gameMemory": "Memory",
  "gameWordle": "Word of the day",
  "gameFlow": "Connect the dots",
  "gameBlocksDesc": "Complete rows and columns",
  "game2048Desc": "Merge matching numbers",
  "gameMemoryDesc": "Find all the pairs",
  "gameWordleDesc": "A new word every day",
  "gameFlowDesc": "Join the colors without crossing",
  "gameBlocksHow": "Drag the pieces onto the 10×10 grid: every complete row or column is cleared. The more lines you clear at once, the more points you get. The game ends when no piece fits. Easy: small pieces; hard: bigger pieces.",
  "game2048How": "Swipe to move all tiles: tiles with the same number merge and double. Reach 2048! Difficulty: easy 5×5, medium 4×4, hard 3×3.",
  "gameMemoryHow": "Flip two cards at a time and find all the pairs in the least time and with the fewest moves. Easy: 6 pairs; medium: 8; hard: 12.",
  "gameWordleHow": "Guess the 5-letter word in 6 tries. Green: right letter in the right place; yellow: letter is in the word but elsewhere; grey: not in the word. The word is the same for everyone and changes every day, in the app's language.",
  "gameArrows": "Arrows",
  "gameArrowsHow": "Tap the arrows to move them off the board, but careful: their path must be clear. Some arrows block others, so pick the right order to complete each level. You have 3 lives: each blocked arrow you tap costs one. Difficulty: bigger board and more arrows.",
