  "gameQuiz": "Catalunya quiz",
  "gameSnakeHow": "Steer the bus with a swipe (or the arrow keys) and eat the bus stops to grow, without hitting yourself. Easy: the edges wrap around; medium and hard: walls block you and the speed is higher.",
  "gameMinesHow": "Uncover every square without a mine. Numbers tell how many mines are around. Long-press (or flag mode) to mark a mine. The first tap is always safe. The harder the level, the more mines.",
  "gameSolitaireHow": "Klondike solitaire: move all cards to the four foundations, from ace to king, by suit. On the columns, stack cards in descending order with alternating colors. Tap a card, then where to put it; a second tap sends it to the foundation.",
  "gameSlideHow": "Slide the tiles to put them in order from 1 onwards, with the empty space at the end. Easy 3×3, medium 4×4, hard 5×5.",
  "gameConnectionsHow": "16 words about Tarragona, Catalonia and Spain: group them into 4 groups of 4 that have something in common. You have 4 mistakes.",
  "gameFlappyHow": "Tap the screen to make the bus jump and fly between the buildings without touching them. The harder the level, the faster you go and the narrower the gaps.",
  "gameQuizHow": "10 mixed questions about Tarragona, Santa Tecla, Spain and Catalonia. Pick the right answer out of four.",
